  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'f1946e0e-32ca-4cf0-86d5-134ac543faa5', 'ebafc632-b9d3-4f0a-83fc-9eeaad9a2820', 'c714d675-9f79-4969-aa3e-70bc893fc2e7', '4b2248fa-831d-47df-8ee2-e7a1722b39f6', $qbx$Analyze the narrator's commitment to the storytelling process, citing specific textual evidence.$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-16-159Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '7c02bd8c-7f1c-4893-8f9c-7340296968b9', NULL, 1),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'f1946e0e-32ca-4cf0-86d5-134ac543faa5', 'ebafc632-b9d3-4f0a-83fc-9eeaad9a2820', 'c714d675-9f79-4969-aa3e-70bc893fc2e7', '4b2248fa-831d-47df-8ee2-e7a1722b39f6', $qbx$Discuss the rhetorical effect of revealing the protagonist's death at the very beginning of the narrative.$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-16-159Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '7c02bd8c-7f1c-4893-8f9c-7340296968b9', NULL, 2),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'f1946e0e-32ca-4cf0-86d5-134ac543faa5', 'ebafc632-b9d3-4f0a-83fc-9eeaad9a2820', 'c714d675-9f79-4969-aa3e-70bc893fc2e7', '4b2248fa-831d-47df-8ee2-e7a1722b39f6', $qbx$Examine the contrast between the Maharaja's extensive formal titles and his popular appellation, 'The Tiger King.' What does this suggest about his public persona or the nature of the story?$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-16-159Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '7c02bd8c-7f1c-4893-8f9c-7340296968b9', NULL, 3),
