  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'f1946e0e-32ca-4cf0-86d5-134ac543faa5', 'ebafc632-b9d3-4f0a-83fc-9eeaad9a2820', 'c714d675-9f79-4969-aa3e-70bc893fc2e7', '4b2248fa-831d-47df-8ee2-e7a1722b39f6', $qbx$Discuss the implications of the astrological prediction for the prince's future reign and personal development.$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-16-159Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '397a88c6-dba1-4e7a-949c-ebcf974f8846', NULL, 3),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'f1946e0e-32ca-4cf0-86d5-134ac543faa5', 'ebafc632-b9d3-4f0a-83fc-9eeaad9a2820', 'c714d675-9f79-4969-aa3e-70bc893fc2e7', '4b2248fa-831d-47df-8ee2-e7a1722b39f6', $qbx$If you were a royal advisor, what preventative measures, if any, would you propose based on this specific prophecy?$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-16-159Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '397a88c6-dba1-4e7a-949c-ebcf974f8846', NULL, 4),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', 'f1946e0e-32ca-4cf0-86d5-134ac543faa5', 'ebafc632-b9d3-4f0a-83fc-9eeaad9a2820', 'c714d675-9f79-4969-aa3e-70bc893fc2e7', '4b2248fa-831d-47df-8ee2-e7a1722b39f6', $qbx$How might the knowledge of his predestined death influence the prince's personality and decision-making as he matures?$qbx$, 'short_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-16-159Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, '397a88c6-dba1-4e7a-949c-ebcf974f8846', NULL, 5),
